    "Survivorship bias: the universe is today's large-caps, so names that were large-caps in 2015 and fell out are absent. This biases backtest returns upward and cannot be corrected without a point-in-time constituent history.",
    "News sentiment covers Reliance only, from 2024-12-10, so news_available is 1 on roughly 1% of panel rows and 0 everywhere else.",
    "TATAMOTORS.NS is fetched as TMPV.NS after the Tata Motors demerger; a demerged entity's pre-demerger history is not a perfectly continuous series.",
    "Prices are yfinance auto-adjusted closes. A vendor restatement of a historical split or dividend would change the panel.",
    "Paper trading assumes a fill at the close with a flat bps cost. It models no market impact, no partial fills, no borrow cost or availability for the short leg, and no circuit limits.",
    "R-squared on next-session returns is approximately zero. The product acts on the calibrated direction head with abstention, not on a return forecast."
